{"id":"wb-5-227","name":"介休后土庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"介休后土庙","text":"介休后土庙位于中国山西省晋中市介休市老城西北角的庙底街，是一大片壮丽的道教宫观建筑群，也是介休现存等级最高的一组古建筑群，是道教全真派的庙宇，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BB%8B%E4%BC%91%E5%90%8E%E5%9C%9F%E5%BA%99","revisionId":84930615,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84930615","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/044f3b9fb49e3e281e184d85.jpg","title":"Jiexiu_Houtu_Miao_2013.08.24_09-41-19.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jiexiu_Houtu_Miao_2013.08.24_09-41-19.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b6/Jiexiu_Houtu_Miao_2013.08.24_09-41-19.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"介休后土庙","width":320,"height":213}}